a) = $0 { return a }; return nil },","    challengeSource: source",")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The generator runs synchronously each time the plugin needs a new challenge (on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".request"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".regenerateChallenge"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".answerRejected"},{"type":"text","text":"). Keep it cheap and pure — no I\/O."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"API surface for the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxParentalGate"},{"type":"text","text":" library — a domain plugin that guards actions behind a math challenge."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/pluginparentalgatereference"]}],"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Redux-style state management for SwiftUI, with macros for observability and ready-made plugins for persistence, undo, paywalls, version killswitches, and parental gates."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"Swidux"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/PluginKillswitchReference":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/pluginkillswitchreference","abstract":[{"text":"Public API surface for the ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxKillswitch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" library — the plugin, its state and actions, the service abstraction, and the version-comparison primitives.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginKillswitchReference","kind":"article","role":"article","title":"SwiduxKillswitch Reference"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/PluginArchitecture":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginArchitecture","title":"Plugin Architecture","role":"article","url":"\/documentati